  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Kazuya 4 electric wind god fist into bound</Major>
    <Description>Hello, This macro allows you to perform a 4 electric wind god fist into bound very very easily. It only requires you to be on the left side of the game. Incase if you fail the hit the electric, change the key press to (while holding) so that you have as less failiures as possible. Kazuya 4 ewgf into bound is very very hard to do and only a few people could do it! Using key ran easily perform this! You need default controls in tekken to perform this </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
